0..55 Comment "//! `derive-eq-over-codes` models generic equality from"
56..87 Comment "//! levitated declaration code."
88..91 Comment "//!"
92..164 Comment "//! `Nat` and `Tagged` give closed codes that `Eq.generic` can traverse."
165..242 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses parameterized and mutually recursive codes."
243..246 Comment "//!"
247..321 Comment "//! The checker lowers the traversal to closed core and judges the result."
322..368 Comment "//! The kernel replays the checked derivation."
369..372 Comment "//!"
373..422 Comment "//! - cites: [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]"
423..426 Comment "//!"
427..576 Comment "//! [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]: https://doi.org/10.1145/1863543.1863547 \"Chapman, Dagand, McBride and Morris, The Gentle Art of Levitation\""
